
Version: 3.2.174352

- Standardized monetary values on the gold icon across chat messages, tooltips, history, and detail views.
- Added a breakdown for the visit/session delta: hover the existing footer row to separate stock movement from price revaluation, or click it to inspect changed materials.
- Corrected delta descriptions to clarify that a stock change can coincide with market-price revaluation.
- Added spacing between the footer guidance and the value-history graph.
- Compacted price history and material baselines in SavedVariables while preserving existing snapshots, price changes, and visit-delta diagnostics.


Version: 3.1.071108

- Improved English and Russian localization: clarified material-change labels, corrected terminology, and completed missing Russian UI strings.
- Reduced SavedVariables size for new material snapshots by storing only the data required for comparison.
- Added chat notification modes: Off, Summary, Important changes, and Detailed withdrawal/price-update reports.



Version: 3.0.220726

Major Milestone Release – First 3.0 Launch

- Fixed extraction, queue, price update, and Coverage display errors.
- Added context lines in the detail window: category, search, filters, snapshot.
- Explicit material actions: ✓ for extraction, + for adding to a package.
- Added table modes: Main / Analytics; Analytics is now the default view.
- Merged single and batch extraction into a single unified window.
- Positions of the detail window and extraction window are now preserved.
- Batch interface is shown only when two or more materials are selected.
- Queue now includes a summary: materials, required cells, cost, and readiness status.
- Improved filters: visible active state, reset, and search clearing.
- Reworked material tooltips: guild trader commissions, technical data, row hover highlighting.
- Main panel now serves as a guide: tips for unset prices, top categories, and snapshot changes.
- Added persistent micro-tips: Accumulated 80%, snapshot status, clear freshness labels for bag and prices.
- Redesigned main panel: enhanced total, subdued footer, highlighted most valuable category, action link with arrow, compact chart.
- Added version date at the bottom of the main window: Addon version as of 22.07.2026.
- Added ReleaseDate to the manifest along with a reminder to update both version and date together.
